# SS-03 - Free real daily-data vertical slice
Workstream ID: SS-03
GitHub issue: https://github.com/Zanark/StonksSniper/issues/3
Status: DONE
Milestone: M1
Dependencies: SS-01

## Purpose
Fetch actual NSE/BSE history without tokens, hidden repairs or fabricated fallback prices.

## Tasks
- [x] Implement replaceable provider contract and Yahoo daily adapter.
- [x] Validate symbol/exchange/currency, OHLC, volume, ordering and provenance.
- [x] Exclude current-day bars and show observation dates, price basis and fetch time.
- [x] Verify actual NSE and BSE requests and explicit provider failures.

## Acceptance criteria
- Real provider checks succeed for representative NSE/BSE symbols or are honestly blocked.
- Failure never returns dummy data; adjusted research prices are not labelled nominal fills.

## Completion evidence
- src/stonks_sniper/providers.py and models.py implemented.
- Provider tests cover validation, current-day exclusion and explicit failures.
- Actual Yahoo requests admitted 494 RELIANCE.NS bars, 494 TCS.NS bars and
  492 TCS.BO bars, covering 2024-11-11 through 2026-11-09.
- 500325.BO failed symbol/history resolution; RELIANCE.BO supplied only an excluded
  current-day bar. Neither request was silently substituted with another instrument.
- Production data qualification belongs to SS-07/SS-14; human acceptance is not recorded.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-11: Implemented initial unofficial personal-research adapter, not an accuracy SLA.
- 2026-11-11: Completed representative NSE/BSE live checks and provider error tests.
  Upstream availability, revisions and independent price accuracy remain unqualified.
